a falling rock, fall into a pit, or just snuff it anyway.  Pets annoy
me, frankly.  I just ditch 'em on the first level (I'd kill them, but
that screws up your luck).

Anyway, I've always envisioned floating eyes sending out a beam.  Bowser
goes to attack, the eye just turns in the air to "look" at Bowser and
sends out a beam and then you've got a doggie lawn ornament
(temporarily).  If the dogs can attack the floating eyes, the floating
eyes should be able to simply look down and paralyze them.

This, of course, begs the question of if Bowser should be able to attack
the eye in the first place if it really is floating.  I'd just say, "it
doesn't say how HIGH it is floating, does it?"

